    "body": "`<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"data:,body{color:blue}\" type=\"text/css\">` adds an entry to `document.styleSheets` at both Chromium and Firefox. At Chromium the `CSSStyleSheet` does not have a `cssRules` property, at Firefox the `CSSStyleSheet` does have a `cssRules` property with the `length` of the `CSSRuleList` set to `0`.",
