    "body": "Firefox 60 has the same behaviour as Firefox 57\r\n\r\n```\r\n<?php \r\n\r\n    header(\"Content-Type: '' \");\r\n    echo \"body{color:blue}\";\r\n\r\nphp?>\r\n```\r\n\r\ndoes apply style rules to the `document`.\r\n\r\nResponse headers\r\n\r\n```\r\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\nConnection: close\r\nContent-Type: ''\r\nHost: localhost:8000\r\n```",
