    "body": "@guest271314 if an document starts with `<!doctype html>` it'll be in \"standards mode\" (no-quirks mode per the specifications).\r\n\r\nI think what you tested was a good start:\r\n* Is `document.styleSheets` affected (test after load has happened/failed)?\r\n* Are the styles applied (e.g., via `getComputedStyle()`)?\r\n* Does the `load` event dispatch on `<link>`?\r\n\r\nDon't think there are many other assertable things here.",
