    "created_at": "2018-02-17T18:27:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-17T18:27:51Z",
    "body": "Including `crossOrigin=\"anonymous\"` to gist request results in `DOMException: The operation is insecure.` not being logged at Firefox 60, though the `error` event is still dispatched and the associated style is not applied to the selector.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
