    "created_at": "2018-02-17T18:48:36Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-17T18:48:36Z",
    "body": "Cross-origin was meant as a stylesheet on a different origin from the HTML document. No `crossorigin` attribute needed (though maybe we should test that as well, but I hope that it doesn't change the results).",
