    "created_at": "2018-02-17T18:55:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-17T19:01:56Z",
    "body": "The only change that can detect when `crossOrigin` attribute set to `\"anonymous\"` is that the error `DOMException: The operation is insecure.` is not logged at `console`.  \r\n\r\nThe differences between Chromium and Firefox that have noticed so far are described at  https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/3457#issuecomment-366460495:\r\n\r\n1. The `error` event is not dispatched at Chromium for any of the tests save for gist request (cross-origin)\r\n2. Firefox dispatches `error` event for all but two requests\r\n3. Firefox applies styles for response having MIME type set to `\"*/*\"` \r\n\r\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/366463235/reactions",
