    "created_at": "2018-09-24T13:35:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-09-24T13:35:35Z",
    "body": "I have tests for this at https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/13144. The HTML Standard does allude to missing and broken `Content-Type` resulting in `text/css` treatment, but this should be spelled out better. While testing I also found some issues with Chrome/Edge/Safari that I don't think are allowed (they're loose for some cases where there's a valid `Content-Type`). I'll file bugs on those.\r\n\r\nIt's a little bit unclear to me how to clarify the standard here, since there isn't a clear loading pipeline as things stand.\r\n\r\ncc @domfarolino ",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
