    "body": "See https://github.com/whatwg/mimesniff/issues/30#issuecomment-423992595 for why I abstained from testing `*/*` for now. It'd be easy to add, but it's unclear to me what the correct result is and where it should be special cased. I suspect we don't want to special case it for style sheet loadding.",
